Now, we set $⟨x,y⟩=0$ and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & =0 \\\\ k-19 & =0 \\\\ k & =19\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-97347/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "46ebecec-2507-5893-8529-69e7bbd61765"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97347"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97352/selection/594f4371237f716a4e7b771cfac6a2ca8b8eb3c8dcb7752f2b3291728275476a" :answer/id #uuid "1576000c-cf8b-598b-98d3-80141362cf9d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97352/selection/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" :answer/id #uuid "ff6a0d7e-80ec-5f26-9f7f-259f3ccc9785" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97352/selection/f114c855cb4980abfc1057e37678c04cac7ea9d9ad649da669e46dcd5213df25" :answer/id #uuid "2fc8af7d-10b8-574c-b1a9-ffc6d88c0f1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-19" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97352/selection/4644593a6ae896793c595e8a37cd468ba91be6a8038e715c4c88cddad1968793" :answer/id #uuid "4fe75b42-00a2-5bb0-900b-6dd1cac45785" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97352/selection/c9ec5d6cdf4e67c7f8bce68475bed400e56bf403f3d09b5928f78b6baa512eab" :answer/id #uuid "8ef3f142-894c-5b10-aa8a-eec2f6e84223" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "27" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97352/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ac5c5251-bf49-502a-89e9-a370b6dea870" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-97352/selection/594f4371237f716a4e7b771cfac6a2ca8b8eb3c8dcb7752f2b3291728275476a" :answer-field/choices ["q-97352/selection/594f4371237f716a4e7b771cfac6a2ca8b8eb3c8dcb7752f2b3291728275476a" "q-97352/selection/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" "q-97352/selection/f114c855cb4980abfc1057e37678c04cac7ea9d9ad649da669e46dcd5213df25" "q-97352/selection/4644593a6ae896793c595e8a37cd468ba91be6a8038e715c4c88cddad1968793" "q-97352/selection/c9ec5d6cdf4e67c7f8bce68475bed400e56bf403f3d09b5928f78b6baa512eab"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-97352" :question/id #uuid "6579b20d-d77a-52e5-a1dc-300255db1f29" :question/math-academy-id "q-97352" :question/problem "Let $V={R}^{3}$ be the vector space equipped with the inner product\n\n$$\n⟨x,y⟩=4{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{3}{y}_{3}.\n$$\n\nIf $x=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ k \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$ and \n$y=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ are orthogonal with respect to the inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ in $V,$ then $k=$" :question/worked-solution "Since $x$ and $y$ are orthogonal, their inner product must be zero.\n\nFirst, we compute the inner product using our definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & =4{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+{x}_{2}{y}_{2} \\\\  & =4\\cdot ((-4)\\cdot (-3))+k\\cdot 2+2\\cdot (4\\cdot 0) \\\\  & =48+2k+0 \\\\  & =48+2k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set $⟨x,y⟩=0$ and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & =0 \\\\ 48+2k & =0 \\\\ 2k & =-48 \\\\ k & =-24\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-97352/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "46ebecec-2507-5893-8529-69e7bbd61765"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97352"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97355/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "01084dae-567d-5a25-ab59-50bf4cc3bca7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97355/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "a0a03d53-6e3c-5d7e-b39b-ef4ddd32654f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:d