e the inner product using our definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨p(t),q(t)⟩ & =p(-4)q(-4)+p(2)q(2)+p(4)q(4) \\\\  & =(k+8)(5-8)+(k-4)(5-2)+(k-8)(5-8) \\\\  & =(-3k-24)+(3k-12)+(-3k+24) \\\\  & =-3k-12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set $⟨p(t),q(t)⟩=0$ and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨p(t),q(t)⟩ & =0 \\\\ -3k-12 & =0 \\\\ 3k & =-12 \\\\ k & =-4\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-97355/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a348cfec-2c8f-5302-a94a-43a6c9330c34"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97355"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-140266/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "40910062-0c54-5d32-bdab-d2068f95f684" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140266/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "b4e12f55-8ceb-5032-a428-ab7ec147bc99" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140266/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "82a3497f-aaf8-5653-893a-4493a6ff5f29" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140266/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "aa524d18-bec7-509c-a367-f87751658ce8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140266/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "369b0f62-2779-50d5-b1fd-48c471c80415" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140266/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "549b46f4-208d-52d8-8905-a6cf8c846898" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-1402